# Ego Drain: "If you don't control a Faerie" reads only Bot1's permanents. Bot2 controls Barrow Naughty, a Faerie; Bot1 controls
# none, so after taking Lightning Bolt from Bot2's hand Bot1 still exiles a card from its own (a Swamp).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Ego Drain
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Barrow Naughty
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Barrow Naughty.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield = Barrow Naughty
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ego Drain.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Choose(Swamp)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
Exile = Swamp
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
